abstract: >-
  PRCoords implements the Chinese coordinate obfuscation methods GCJ-02 and
  BD-09: forward transform WGS-84 -> GCJ-02 and GCJ02 -> BD-09, plus one-step
  and iterative inverses.
  There are versions in Python, JavaScript, C/C++ (C ABI), PostgreSQL, and more.

